    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "•Coonan Property presents this spacious four-bedroom family home, ideally positioned within the popular Windermere development, just a short walk from Clonsilla Village and train station. \n•Extending to approximately 124 sq.m., the property offers generous and well-proportioned accommodation throughout. \n•Accommodation comprises entrance hallway, guest W.C., living room, kitchen/dining area, four generous bedrooms including a master with ensuite, and family bathroom. \n•Large site with a south-east facing rear garden and a front driveway providing ample off-street parking. \n•Offers excellent potential to extend to the rear and convert the attic space, subject to the necessary planning permission. \n•Ideally positioned overlooking a large green area, providing a safe play area for families with young children. \n•Within walking distance of Clonsilla Village and Clonsilla Train Station, with a good selection of schools, shops and local amenities nearby. \n•Blanchardstown Shopping Centre and Connolly Hospital are within easy reach, while the M3 and M50 provide easy access to the wider Dublin area. \n•Well served by public transport, with regular bus services and Clonsilla and Hansfield train stations both easily accessible.\n\n\nGuide Price\n495,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Driveway\nCobble lock driveway, outdoor light fitting and side entrance with wooden gate. \n\nEntrance Hallway (Including Guest W.C.) 6m x 1.9m \nTiled flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, coving, storage under stairway and alarm panel. \n\nGuest W.C. 1.5m x 0.9m\nTiled flooring, light fitting, w.c., w.h.b., fitted mirror, roller blinds and window. \n\nLiving Room 3.6m x 7m\nLaminate flooring, hanging pendant light, fitted wall lights, bay window, double French doors leading to kitchen/dining area and a gas fire place with granite hearth. \n \nKitchen/Dining Area 5.7m x 3.4m, 2.7m x 2.7m \nTiled flooring, light fitting, shaker style floor to wall kitchen cabinets, gas hob, double oven, extractor fan, stainless steel sink, fully plumbed with washing machine, free standing fridge/freezer, tiled splashback and sliding glass door that leads to rear garden. \n\nLanding 3.1m x 4.3m\nCarpet flooring on stairway, laminate flooring on landing, hanging pendant light with shade, roller blinds, access to attic space and hot press with shelving. \n\nMaster Bedroom (Front) 3.2m x 5.1m\nLaminate flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, fitted wardrobes with overhead cabinets and fitted mirrors. \n\nEnsuite 2.3m x 1m\nTiled flooring, light fitting, extractor fan, w.c., w.h.b. with tiled splashback and shower cubicle \n\nBedroom 2 (Front) 2.4m x 3.1m \nLaminate flooring, hanging pendant light with shade and fitted wardrobes. \n \nBedroom 3 (Rear) 3.5m x 2.3m\nLaminate flooring, hanging pendant light, roller blinds and fitted wardrobe with fitted mirror. \n\nBedroom 4 (Rear) 3.2m x 2.9m\nLaminate flooring, light fitting, roller blinds and fitted wardrobe with mirror. \n\nFamily Bathroom 1.4m x 2.6m\nTiled flooring with semi tiled walls, light fitting, Velux window, w.c., w.h.b. with fitted mirror and bath with shower screen. \n\nGarden \nSouth/East facing, lawn area and block wall surround. \n\nAdditional Information:\nGross internal floor area approx. 124 sq.m. (1,335 sq.ft)\nBuilt c.2000\nPVC fascia and soffits \nWired for alarm \nOff street parking\nLow maintenance red brick and dashed exterior finish\n\nItems Included in sale:\nHob, double ovens, washing machine, free standing fridge/freezer, all curtains, blinds and light shades. \n\nServices\nMains water \nGas fired central heating \n\nBER \nC\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: D15 H1XV\n\nContact Information\nMick Wright\n"
      },
